ds.","src","/GameMap/media/learning/pixel-orchard-astra.webp","alt","Two revealed seed-packet symbols on a twelve-card memory board, with one move and zero matched pairs.","https://miaai-lab.github.io/GPT-6-Astra-100-HTML-Files/013-pixel-orchard.html","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap browser capture","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型","items",[86],"其他 / 未指定代理","links","创作者开发记录",[92],"evidence","section",{"_61":93,"_25":94,"_95":96},"查看作者的生成过程说明","https://github.com/MiaAI-Lab/GPT-6-Astra-100-HTML-Files/blob/main/README.md","note","The author describes these as Astra-generated standalone HTML studies; this particular entry includes a complete playable memory-game loop and its exact prompt.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[101],{"_61":102,"_25":103,"_95":104},"查看完整游戏项目","https://github.com/MiaAI-Lab/GPT-6-Astra-100-HTML-Files/blob/main/013-pixel-orchard.html","The single HTML file contains the entire game, inline CSS, shuffled deck, matching, move counter and reset logic. It opens offline without assets, packages or a build step. No explicit code license was observed.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[110],{"_61":111,"_25":74,"_95":112},"试玩 Pixel Orchard","English interface; click, tap or focus card buttons with the keyboard. PLANT AGAIN reshuffles and resets the round. No login, installation or network dependencies after loading.","游戏平台","浏览器","指南形式","prompt","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[120],{"_61":121,"_25":122,"_95":-7},"查看游戏的原始提示词","https://github.com/MiaAI-Lab/GPT-6-Astra-100-HTML-Files/blob/main/013-pixel-orchard.txt","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[127,128,129,130],"Flip two cards and watch how matches and mismatches behave.","Compare the exact prompt with the complete inline implementation.","Inspect shuffle, turn locking and reset during a delayed mismatch.","Change the deck and complete a round, then verify reset and keyboard access.","AI 工作流与开发背景","MiaAI-Lab 将整个合集标为 GPT-6 Astra 生成，并保留本作的准确提示，明确要求配对、重置和快速输入保护。公开材料没有说明具体聊天或编码客户端，也没有披露人工修改范围。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 生成（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","2D","track","metadata","引擎","DOM/CSS · Vanilla JavaScript","engine","lead","2d","ai-generated",[127,128,129,130],{"_61":161,"_25":122,"_17":116},{"_61":160,"_25":74,"_17":106,"_95":112},{"_61":157,"_25":103,"_158":159,"_95":104},{"_61":156,"_25":94,"_95":96},"resourceIds",[],"Read the creator’s generation disclosure","Open the complete game project","scope","complete-project","Play Pixel Orchard","Read the exact game prompt",{"_163":164},"documents",{"_66":165,"_35":166},[168,172,173,174,171,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,170,207,169,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228],[167,168,169,170,171],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-design/SKILL","skills/level-design/LICENSE","design/design-system","design/v2/design-system","editorial-art-prompts","skills/level-design/references/blockout-metrics","skills/level-design/references/case-studies","skills/level-design/references/